    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">This sensory romp around the globe goes in search of the biological roots of our senses to uncover the reasons why particular sights, sounds, smells and tastes have such powerful effects on us. How do we manage to block out intense pain? How does our sense of balance keep working under the most extreme conditions? Live action combined with special effects creates incredible imagery to convey the &apos;feeling&apos; of how our senses work.</marc:subfield>
